<title>POLAND: Four banks underwrite Polish Stalprodukt IPO.</title>
<headline>Four banks underwrite Polish Stalprodukt IPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    steel products maker</p>
<p>						Stalprodukt SA</p>
<p> Total Issue Size (No of Shares):   1,200,000</p>
<p> Issue Type:				common shares</p>
<p> Price (PLN):			     25</p>
<p> Underwriter:			    SHARES	    STAND-BY FEE</p>
<p>					     UNDERWRITTEN    (PCT)</p>
<p> Pekao SA				  450,000	     2.5</p>
<p> PKO BP				    200,000	     2.5</p>
<p> Bank Zachodni SA			 50,000	     2.5</p>
<p> Bank Rozwoju Exportu   100,000	     2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Stalprodukt did not say whether it would underwrite the issue's remaining 400,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
